qoder (0.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release from upstream .deb (Electron 43.1.1 / Chromium 150.0.7871.114).
  * override_dh_fixperms restores mode 4755 on chrome-sandbox after
    dh_fixperms clears the setuid bit; override_dh_strip keeps the payload
    byte-identical to upstream.
  * Upstream's 1: epoch is deliberately not carried here: the CI recipe gate
    pins dsc Version == spec Version, and Debian ships no qoder package this
    repack has to outrank. The RPM keeps it as Epoch: 1.

 -- Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:37:00 +0000
